{"file":"skipper-1.5.0-v2.zip","bytes":316392,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"skipper","description":"Claude Code framework that scaffolds, documents, and maintains your project following Clean Code and SOLID. Detects the stack, generates an opinionated CLAUDE.md, keeps living docs (ADRs/PRDs/plans), and ships specialist subagents that refactor with stack-aware judgment. v1.4 adds Skipper Memory (queryable cited decision graph); v1.5 adds spec-anchored SDD: living SPECs + an evidence-backed delivery gate with content-bound receipts.","version":"1.5.0","license":"MIT","keywords":["framework","documentation","adr","prd","architecture","solid","clean-code","skipper","memory","knowledge-graph","mcp"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/architect/SKILL.md","name":"architect","description":"Invokes the architect — subagent that reasons about project structure, layers and dependencies. Applies the laws declared in CLAUDE.md. Use for \"is this structure ok?\", \"where should this live?\", structural refactors.","headings":["Skipper :: Architect","Contexto en vivo","Tu tarea"],"name_hint":"architect","description_zh":"调用架构专项子智能体分析项目结构、分层和依赖，遵循 CLAUDE.md 中声明的规则。适用于结构评估、代码归属和结构重构。"},{"path":"skills/ask/SKILL.md","name":"ask","description":"Free-form question that captain Skipper routes to the right specialist based on edited paths, intent (keywords) and project stack. Shortcut when you're not sure which specialist to invoke manually. Use for \"is this structure ok?\", \"this smells bad\", open questions.","headings":["Skipper :: Ask (router inteligente)","Contexto a evaluar","Tu tarea: enrutar al especialista correcto","Prioridad 1: Intención explícita en la pregunta","Prioridad 2: Paths editados","Prioridad 3: Stack del proyecto","Caso fallback","Output esperado"],"name_hint":"ask","description_zh":"由 Skipper 依据编辑路径、意图关键词和技术栈，将开放问题分流给适合的专家。适用于不确定调用哪个专项技能时的结构或质量提问。"},{"path":"skills/decide/SKILL.md","name":"decide","description":"Facilitate a decision (problem then real options then tradeoffs then recommendation) and capture it as a complete, pre-filled ADR — the brainstorm-to-decision loop. Use when you are about to make, or just made, a technical or product decision with real alternatives and want it recorded instead of lost in a chat thread.","headings":["Decidir y registrar (brainstorm → ADR)","Pasos","Reglas"],"name_hint":"decide","description_zh":"依次明确问题、实际可选方案、权衡和建议，促成技术或产品决策并记录为完整预填的 ADR。适用于存在真实替代方案且需保存的决策。"},{"path":"skills/docs-doctor/SKILL.md","name":"docs-doctor","description":"Diagnoses the health of docs/ — stale docs (code moved while the doc didn't), stub ADRs/PRDs/plans with unfilled template placeholders, broken intra-doc links, and empty folders. Read-only, reports a severity table. Use periodically or before a release.","headings":["Skipper :: docs-doctor","Reporte automático","Tu tarea","1. Validación previa","2. Tabla de hallazgos","3. Resumen y siguiente paso","Reglas duras"],"name_hint":"文档 · doctor","description_zh":"只读诊断 docs/ 健康，检查代码变化后过期文档、仍含占位符的 ADR/PRD/计划、文档内坏链接及空目录，并报告严重程度表。适用于定期或发布前检查。"},{"path":"skills/goal/SKILL.md","name":"goal","description":"Memory-aware grilling to lock the objective before building. Consults the project's existing decisions (ADRs/PRDs) FIRST, then asks only the genuinely-open clarifying questions, and states an explicit goal + acceptance criteria grounded in those decisions. Use before implementing anything non-trivial, or whenever the request is fuzzy.","headings":["Objetivo claro antes de construir (grilling con memoria)","Pasos","Reglas"],"name_hint":"goal","description_zh":"在构建前先查项目现有 ADR/PRD，再通过追问澄清真正未决的问题，形成有既有决策依据的明确目标和验收条件。适用于非简单实现或模糊请求。"},{"path":"skills/init-structure/SKILL.md","name":"init-structure","description":"Creates the initial docs/ structure for the project type (app, service or library), with a protocol README.md in each folder, then detects the stack and offers to apply an opinionated profile. Use once when adopting the plugin in a project.","headings":["Init estructura de docs","Paso 0 — Detecta stack y decide el tipo de proyecto","Paso 1 — Crea las carpetas del tipo elegido","app","service","library","Paso 1.5 — Asegura el `.gitignore`","Paso 2 — README de cada carpeta","Architecture Decision Records (ADRs)","Cuándo crear un ADR","Cuándo NO","Formato","Ciclo de vida (Status)","Inmutabilidad","Índice","Product Requirement Documents (PRDs)","Estructura","Índice"],"name_hint":"init · structure","description_zh":"按应用、服务或库类型创建初始 docs/ 结构，在各目录加入协议 README.md，识别技术栈并提供特定配置方案。适用于项目首次接入插件。"},{"path":"skills/lib-lookup/SKILL.md","name":"lib-lookup","description":"Looks up libraries/patterns in official docs (WebSearch + WebFetch) scoped to the current stack. Useful for \"what lib should I use for X?\", \"shadcn or radix?\", \"latest TanStack Query API\". The stack specialist performs the search and summarizes with judgment.","headings":["Lib lookup","Contexto","Tu tarea","Pasos","Formato de respuesta","Recomendación: <lib elegida>","Cómo se ve usándola en tu stack","Alternativa considerada: <lib2>","Fuentes","Reglas duras"],"name_hint":"lib · lookup","description_zh":"由技术栈专家使用 WebSearch 和 WebFetch 查询适配当前栈的官方库文档与模式，综合判断并总结。适用于库选型、方案比较和最新 API 查询。"},{"path":"skills/new-adr/SKILL.md","name":"new-adr","description":"Creates a new numbered ADR in docs/decisions/ with the standard format. Takes the title as argument.","headings":["Nuevo ADR","Pasos","Reglas"],"name_hint":"new · adr","description_zh":"以标题为参数，在 docs/decisions/ 按标准格式创建编号 ADR。"},{"path":"skills/new-plan/SKILL.md","name":"new-plan","description":"Creates a new numbered implementation plan in docs/plans/ with the standard format. Takes the title as argument.","headings":["Nuevo plan","Pasos","Reglas"],"name_hint":"new · 规划","description_zh":"以标题为参数，在 docs/plans/ 按标准格式创建编号实施计划。"},{"path":"skills/new-prd/SKILL.md","name":"new-prd","description":"Creates a new numbered PRD in docs/prds/ with the standard format. Takes the title as argument.","headings":["Nuevo PRD","Pasos","Reglas"],"name_hint":"new · prd","description_zh":"以标题为参数，在 docs/prds/ 按标准格式创建编号 PRD。"},{"path":"skills/new-spec/SKILL.md","name":"new-spec","description":"Creates a new numbered SPEC in docs/specs/ — the living, verifiable anchor for spec-anchored SDD (ADR-0024). Takes the title as argument.","headings":["Nuevo SPEC","Pasos","Reglas"],"name_hint":"new · spec","description_zh":"以标题为参数，在 docs/specs/ 创建编号 SPEC，作为基于规格的 SDD 可持续维护和验证的依据，原说明关联 ADR-0024。"},{"path":"skills/nextjs/SKILL.md","name":"nextjs","description":"Invokes the Next.js 14+ App Router specialist. Knows RSC, Server Actions, route handlers, middleware, next-auth, Supabase SSR. Applies the laws from an nextjs-* stack. Can write. Use for Next.js questions/refactors.","headings":["Skipper :: Next.js","Contexto","Tu tarea"],"name_hint":"nextjs","description_zh":"调用 Next.js 14+ App Router 专家，处理 RSC、Server Actions、route handlers、middleware、next-auth 和 Supabase SSR，遵循 nextjs-* 技术栈规则，可编写代码及重构。"},{"path":"skills/node-backend/SKILL.md","name":"node-backend","description":"Invokes the Node.js backend specialist (Fastify + Zod + Drizzle). Knows routes/services/repositories layers, JWT, global error handling. Applies the laws from a node-api stack. Can write. Use for Node API questions/refactors.","headings":["Skipper :: Node Backend","Contexto","Tu tarea"],"name_hint":"node · 后端","description_zh":"调用 Node.js 后端专家，使用 Fastify、Zod、Drizzle，处理路由/服务/仓储分层、JWT 和全局错误，遵循 node-api 技术栈规则，可编写代码及重构。"},{"path":"skills/react-native/SKILL.md","name":"react-native","description":"Invokes the React Native + Expo specialist. Knows expo-router, data/domain/presentation layers, Zustand, NativeWind, expo-secure-store, Supabase Auth on mobile. Applies the laws from an expo-* stack. Can write. Use for RN/Expo questions/refactors.","headings":["Skipper :: React Native + Expo","Contexto","Tu tarea"],"name_hint":"react · native","description_zh":"调用 React Native/Expo 专家，处理 expo-router、数据/领域/展示分层、Zustand、NativeWind、expo-secure-store 和移动 Supabase Auth，遵循 expo-* 规则，可编写代码及重构。"},{"path":"skills/react-vite/SKILL.md","name":"react-vite","description":"Invokes the React + Vite specialist. Knows features-first, TanStack Query, Zustand, Tailwind/shadcn, Zod. Applies the laws from a react-vite-* stack CLAUDE.md. Can write. Use for React SPA questions/refactors.","headings":["Skipper :: React + Vite","Contexto","Tu tarea"],"name_hint":"react · vite","description_zh":"调用 React/Vite 专家，处理功能优先组织、TanStack Query、Zustand、Tailwind/shadcn 和 Zod，遵循 react-vite-* 的 CLAUDE.md 规则，可编写代码及重构。"},{"path":"skills/refactor/SKILL.md","name":"refactor","description":"Refactors a file applying Clean Code and SOLID. Always delegates to solid-coach in an isolated subagent. The subagent reads the file, proposes a change table, waits for confirmation and applies with Edit. Use with the path of the file to refactor.","headings":["Skipper :: Refactor","Contexto","Validación","Flujo","Reglas duras"],"name_hint":"refactor","description_zh":"按文件路径执行 Clean Code 和 SOLID 重构，始终委派隔离的 solid-coach 子智能体读取文件、提出变更表，等待确认后通过 Edit 修改。"},{"path":"skills/review/SKILL.md","name":"review","description":"Reviews the current diff (vs origin/main) using the project's stack specialist. Captain Skipper analyzes the diff and routes to the right specialist. Detects CLAUDE.md violations and stack-specific anti-patterns. Use before commit/PR.","headings":["Skipper :: Review","Contexto a evaluar","Tu tarea: enrutar review al especialista del stack","Review anclado a SPEC (ADR-0024 / PRD-0006 M2)","Output"],"name_hint":"评审","description_zh":"评审当前相对 origin/main 的差异，由 Skipper 分析后分派对应技术栈专家，检查 CLAUDE.md 违规及技术栈反模式。适用于提交或 PR 前复核。"},{"path":"skills/scan/SKILL.md","name":"scan","description":"Detects the current project stack (React Vite, Next.js, Expo, Supabase, Node API, Python FastAPI). Reports candidate, confidence and signals. Does NOT write — analysis only. Use when the user asks \"what stack do I have?\", \"detect my stack\", or before applying a profile.","headings":["Detectar stack del proyecto","Reporte automático","Tu tarea","Stacks soportados v0.2","Output esperado (ejemplo)"],"name_hint":"scan","description_zh":"只读识别项目技术栈，包括 React Vite、Next.js、Expo、Supabase、Node API 和 Python FastAPI，报告候选、置信度及判断信号。适用于栈识别或应用配置前分析。"},{"path":"skills/setup/SKILL.md","name":"setup","description":"Guided one-time Skipper setup — detects stack, picks an architecture preset, writes the Definition-of-Done policy, and (optionally) indexes memory. Classifies new vs existing project. The deterministic CLI infers/renders; this skill only conducts.","headings":["Skipper :: Setup","Contexto (determinista)","Paso 0 — Clasificar el repo (greenfield vs brownfield)","Pasos","Reglas"],"name_hint":"设置","description_zh":"一次性引导 Skipper 设置，区分新旧项目、识别栈、选择架构预设、写入完成定义政策并可选索引记忆。确定性 CLI 负责推断和渲染，本技能负责引导。"},{"path":"skills/solid-coach/SKILL.md","name":"solid-coach","description":"Invokes solid-coach — subagent that reviews Clean Code and SOLID in specific functions/classes/components. Refactors directly. Use for \"does this component respect SRP?\", \"smells bad\", \"extract hook\", \"refactor\".","headings":["Skipper :: SOLID Coach","Contexto","Tu tarea"],"name_hint":"solid · coach","description_zh":"调用 solid-coach 子智能体检查具体函数、类及组件的 Clean Code 和 SOLID，并直接重构。适用于单一职责、代码异味及提取 hook。"},{"path":"skills/stack-add/SKILL.md","name":"stack-add","description":"Adds a layer (tailwind, shadcn-ui, tanstack-query, zustand, zod, nativewind) to the project's CLAUDE.md. Inserts an opinionated fragment with rules and anti-patterns inside idempotent HTML markers. Layers stack without overwriting the stack or other layers.","headings":["Skipper :: stack-add","Validación previa","Pasos","1. Lee el layer","2. Valida compatibilidad","3. Idempotencia","4. NO toques otras secciones","5. Reporta","Reglas duras"],"name_hint":"stack · add","description_zh":"向 CLAUDE.md 添加 Tailwind、shadcn-ui、TanStack Query、Zustand、Zod 或 NativeWind 规则层，在幂等 HTML 标记中插入规则与反模式，不覆盖原栈或其他层。"},{"path":"skills/stack-apply/SKILL.md","name":"stack-apply","description":"Applies a stack profile to the current project. Generates/updates CLAUDE.md (skipper:stack section bounded by HTML markers) and creates docs/architecture/stack.md. Uses opinionated templates from stacks/<id>/. Takes the stack id as argument.","headings":["Aplicar perfil de stack","Validación previa","Pasos","1. Lee el perfil","2. Lee templates","3. Sustituye variables en ambos templates","4. Aplica a CLAUDE.md (idempotente)","5. Crea/actualiza docs/architecture/stack.md","6. Actualiza docs/index.md (si existe)","7. Reporta","Reglas duras"],"name_hint":"stack · apply","description_zh":"以栈编号为参数应用 stacks/<id>/ 预设，生成或更新 CLAUDE.md 中 HTML 标记限定的 skipper:stack 区块，并创建 docs/architecture/stack.md。"},{"path":"skills/stack-doctor/SKILL.md","name":"stack-doctor","description":"Validates that the project code follows the laws declared in CLAUDE.md (structure, naming, anti-patterns). Reports a violations table by severity. Delegates to the architect agent in context fork. Use periodically or before large PRs.","headings":["Skipper :: stack-doctor","Contexto","Tu tarea (eres architect en context fork)","Reglas duras","Output final"],"name_hint":"stack · doctor","description_zh":"验证项目代码是否遵循 CLAUDE.md 的结构、命名及反模式规则，按严重程度报告违规表，通过上下文分叉委派架构智能体。适用于定期或大型 PR 前检查。"},{"path":"skills/stack-sync/SKILL.md","name":"stack-sync","description":"Compares package.json against the skipper:stack block in CLAUDE.md and reports drift — libraries installed but undocumented, and libraries declared but no longer installed (phantom). Read-only. Use periodically, after adding/removing dependencies, or before a release.","headings":["Skipper :: stack-sync","Reporte automático","Tu tarea","1. Validaciones previas","2. Reporta el desfase","3. Ofrece arreglar (NO automático)","Output final","Reglas duras"],"name_hint":"stack · 同步","description_zh":"只读比较 package.json 与 CLAUDE.md 的 skipper:stack，报告已安装未记录及已声明但未安装的依赖偏移。适用于增删依赖后、定期或发布前检查。"},{"path":"skills/supabase/SKILL.md","name":"supabase","description":"Invokes the Supabase specialist. Knows RLS policies, auth flow, Storage, Realtime, Edge Functions, SQL migrations. Enforces security rules (every table with RLS enabled). Can write migrations, policies and queries. Use for RLS, auth, queries, migrations, Realtime.","headings":["Skipper :: Supabase","Contexto","Tu tarea"],"name_hint":"supabase","description_zh":"调用 Supabase 专家处理 RLS、认证、Storage、Realtime、Edge Functions 和 SQL 迁移，可编写迁移、策略及查询。原说明要求所有表启用 RLS 等安全规则。"},{"path":"skills/supersede-adr/SKILL.md","name":"supersede-adr","description":"Supersedes an existing ADR with a new one. ADRs are immutable — when a past decision changes you don't rewrite it, you supersede it. Marks the old ADR 'Superseded by ADR-NNNN', creates the replacement with 'Supersedes ADR-MMMM', links both, and updates the index. Takes the old ADR number and the new title.","headings":["Supersede un ADR","Validación previa","Pasos","Reglas duras"],"name_hint":"supersede · adr","description_zh":"以旧编号和新标题创建替代 ADR，保持历史决策不可改写；在旧文标记 Superseded by、新文标记 Supersedes，双向链接并更新索引。适用于既有决策改变。"},{"path":"skills/update/SKILL.md","name":"update","description":"Reviews recent changes (git diff/log) and proposes updates to docs/ — ADRs, PRDs, plans, architecture, business. Use when the user says \"update docs\", \"document this\", or after a large feature.","headings":["Update docs (corre en subagent kowalski aislado)","Contexto en vivo (preprocesado antes del subagent)","Tu tarea","Flujo (en este subagent)","Reglas duras (sé conservador)","Reporte final (lo único que regresa al chat principal)"],"name_hint":"更新","description_zh":"审查近期 Git diff/log，并提出 docs/ 中 ADR、PRD、计划、架构及业务文档的更新。适用于记录变化或大型功能完成后整理。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["🐧 skipper","🧠 Skipper Memory — *new in v1.4*","⚓ Spec-anchored SDD — *the delivery gate*","Why skipper","The problem","The solution","30-second demo","Install","In your project:","Working:","Validate before PR:","Instal